markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>The IPSO Model</h1>

<p>The IPSO model describes how a computer system works in four steps:</p>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto;">

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">I</div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background-color: #F7F7FB; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3>Input</h3>
      <p>The computer receives data (e.g., typing on a keyboard, clicking a mouse, or scanning a barcode).</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">P</div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background-color: #F7F7FB; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3>Processing</h3>
      <p>The device takes input data and uses instructions to make decisions or perform actions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">S</div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background-color: #F7F7FB; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3>Storage</h3>
      <p>The data is saved temporarily (RAM) or permanently (hard drive, SSD).</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;">
    <div style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;">O</div>
    <div style="flex: 1; background-color: #F7F7FB; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px;">
      <h3>Output</h3>
      <p>The processed data is displayed or used (e.g., shown on a screen, printed, or played as sound).</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<p>Together, these steps allow a computer system to take in information, process it, store it, and produce useful results.</p>

<div style="width:100%; overflow-x:auto; margin:24px 0;">

  <div role="group" aria-label="Diagram showing input moving to process and then output. The process also sends information to and retrieves information from storage." style="width:620px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius:12px; box-shadow:0 2px 7px rgba(0,0,0,0.10); font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

 <!-- Input, Process, Output -->
  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:100%;">

  <!-- Input -->
 <div style="width:170px; height:70px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#CCF1D0; color:#000000; border:2px solid #34BD43; border-radius:12px; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold;">
        Input
   </div>

   <!-- Arrow -->
   <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:55px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
        <div style="width:30px; height:14px; background-color:#FFE3CE; border-top:2px solid #F46B00; border-bottom:2px solid #F46B00; border-left:2px solid #F46B00; box-sizing:border-box;"></div>
        <div style="width:0; height:0; border-top:13px solid transparent; border-bottom:13px solid transparent; border-left:15px solid #F46B00;"></div>
      </div>
     <!-- Process -->
      <div style="width:170px; height:70px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#CCF1D0; color:#000000; border:2px solid #34BD43; border-radius:12px; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold;">
        Process
      </div>
      <!-- Arrow -->
      <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:55px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
        <div style="width:30px; height:14px; background-color:#FFE3CE; border-top:2px solid #F46B00; border-bottom:2px solid #F46B00; border-left:2px solid #F46B00; box-sizing:border-box;"></div>
        <div style="width:0; height:0; border-top:13px solid transparent; border-bottom:13px solid transparent; border-left:15px solid #F46B00;"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- Output -->
      <div style="width:170px; height:70px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#CCF1D0; color:#000000; border:2px solid #34BD43; border-radius:12px; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold;">
        Output
      </div>

   </div>
    <!-- Two-way arrows -->
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="height:58px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; color:#E62378; font-size:38px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1;">
      <span>↑</span>
      <span>↓</span>
    </div>

   <!-- Storage cylinder -->
  <!-- Storage cylinder -->
<div style="position:relative; width:180px; height:82px; margin:0 auto;">

  <!-- Cylinder body -->
  <div style="position:absolute; left:0; top:13px; width:180px; height:53px; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#D5EFFF; border-left:2px solid #0099F3; border-right:2px solid #0099F3; z-index:1;"></div>

  <!-- Top oval -->
  <div style="position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:180px; height:28px; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#D5EFFF; border:2px solid #0099F3; border-radius:50%; z-index:2;"></div>

  <!-- Bottom front curve -->
  <div style="position:absolute; left:0; top:51px; width:180px; height:28px; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:#D5EFFF; border-left:2px solid #0099F3; border-right:2px solid #0099F3; border-bottom:2px solid #0099F3; border-radius:0 0 50% 50%; z-index:2;"></div>

  <!-- Storage label -->
  <div style="position:absolute; left:0; top:32px; width:180px; color:#000000; text-align:center; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.2; z-index:4;">
    Storage
  </div>

</div>
  </div>

  </div>

</div>

<div style="background-color: #D5EFFF; color: #06338D; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0;">
<p>🔎 <b>Think About:</b> the next level covers different types of hardware. As you click through the panels, try to classify which part of the IPSO model each part belongs to.</p>
</div>
